    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/a47b18ffcd31fb287e4b1e56a9819c92.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/a47b18ffcd31fb287e4b1e56a9819c92.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/a47b18ffcd31fb287e4b1e56a9819c92.mp4?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><i>Magin: The Rat Project Stories</i> takes place in a dark fantasy world, where magic \u2013 or essence, as it is called \u2013 is directly tied to the desires and fears of its inhabitants. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape the fate of Elester, a Magin and veteran hitman in an underworld syndicate, as well as young Tolen, who is about to realize that he too can use the essence to his advantage. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a mature, magical world standing on the edge of an industrial revolution and utter chaos.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overcome obstacles, play your cards wisely, and find your destiny in this immersive, story-driven adventure. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8693fe5f6fb7a66a03b8ac744c0e0c1e.avif?t=1754257160\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore atmospheric and mysterious locations by investigating the environment, and interacting with items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle horrific creatures and meet numerous complex characters - potential allies or foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5d3ae143e7584d84ede0bb02ac686667.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5d3ae143e7584d84ede0bb02ac686667.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5d3ae143e7584d84ede0bb02ac686667.mp4?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/f12ecac3154bd58ec9b0977b410f9111.avif?t=1754257160\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your essence by utilizing emotions, both in combat and during exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The emotional state of your character influences the story and various gameplay mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/2f1719a0cc9482b2e2db6f6b080687f6.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/2f1719a0cc9482b2e2db6f6b080687f6.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/2f1719a0cc9482b2e2db6f6b080687f6.mp4?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/bca20fe4bbdfbcedb7386d855db1772b.avif?t=1754257160\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a cold and harsh fantasy world where medieval culture is confronted with the invention of industrial, magic-powered machines, and the forces that seek to control them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the main characters on their journey of lost and redeemed hope and decide its outcome based on your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0f0a79e0710ffc46586b5a69dc6fa0ef.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0f0a79e0710ffc46586b5a69dc6fa0ef.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0f0a79e0710ffc46586b5a69dc6fa0ef.mp4?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/2d6b77acd5cdfc4bf6f34023986872c2.avif?t=1754257160\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage and upgrade your deck as the story progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain special cards from story choices and defeated enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft unique double-sided, emotion-infused essence cards fitting your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/871c1373a43b0a2b3842911031838885.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/871c1373a43b0a2b3842911031838885.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/871c1373a43b0a2b3842911031838885.mp4?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
