re medieval culture is confronted with the invention of industrial, magic-powered machines, and the forces that seek to control them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the main characters on their journey of lost and redeemed hope and decide its outcome based on your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0f0a79e0710ffc46586b5a69dc6fa0ef.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0f0a79e0710ffc46586b5a69dc6fa0ef.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0f0a79e0710ffc46586b5a69dc6fa0ef.mp4?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/2d6b77acd5cdfc4bf6f34023986872c2.avif?t=1754257160\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage and upgrade your deck as the story progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain special cards from story choices and defeated enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft unique double-sided, emotion-infused essence cards fitting your strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/871c1373a43b0a2b3842911031838885.poster.avif?t=1754257160\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/871c1373a43b0a2b3842911031838885.webm?t=1754257160\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/871c13